# Smile Therapy

> Smile Therapy (https://www.smile-therapy.co.uk) is a UK-based oral care brand selling 100% vegan, at-home dental care products including teeth whitening kits, ultrasonic tooth cleaners, electric toothbrushes, water flossers, tongue scrapers, and oral care serums. Free UK next-day delivery on all orders, no minimum spend.

## About

Smile Therapy specialises in professional-level oral care designed for home use. All products are vegan, cruelty-free, and certified safe. Products are priced between £13.99 and £49.99 GBP. The brand has over 6,000 reviews on Trustpilot and tens of thousands of individual product reviews on-site. The store also sells on Amazon UK.

