## Shipping and Returns

Free UK next-day delivery on all orders with no minimum spend. All orders placed by 4pm are shipped same day. Returns must be requested before sending items back — contact the store first to confirm the return address.

## Frequently Asked Questions

Smile Therapy products are safe for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. All products are 100% vegan and cruelty-free. The V34 Colour Corrector uses colour-correcting technology (not bleach) for instant visual whitening. The PAP+ whitening kits use peroxide-free PAP+ formula suitable for sensitive teeth. Products contain no peroxide.

## Target Customers

People looking for affordable, effective, vegan-friendly at-home teeth whitening and oral care products in the UK. Common use cases include whitening sensitive teeth without bleach, removing plaque buildup at home, upgrading from manual to electric oral care, and eco-friendly dental hygiene alternatives.
